                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1]Even after 18 years, Street Fighter IV still remains one of the greatest fighting games of all time.[/h1] \nThis game is legendary and can produce matches with enough hype to dwarf all other SF games that came after it. With a skill ceiling that's near limitless and a diverse array of characters to learn and master, this strikes the perfect balance for beginner accessibility and competitive spectacle. Unfortunately, this game was never updated to have rollback netcode so online play was a less than ideal experience. Until now.\nWith [url=https://embernetplay.link/]Ember Netplay[/url], long distance matches are now playable. You'll no longer have to deal with the game's archaic delay based netcode and rank spoofing players online. If you're going to play this game, use this mod. There's never been a better time to play Ultra Street Fighter IV.",
                        "timestamp_created": 1791860141,
